"""The care needs that crises create, and how they map to the model's six care lines.

Each need says which layer it belongs to, what share of a care line's direct referrals it makes up in each kind
of crisis, whether it can move abroad, and which health tourism capacity could serve it. Evidence is in
data/raw/needs. Statements here were read through automated fetching and must be checked against the originals
before they enter a manuscript. A "judge" field holds the authors' own judgement where no source was found.
"""

